{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1234だ！わーい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1日\n岩手と青森にいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんとひめたんとだよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\n今日、出演した生放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つ目は\nRAB青森放送『GO!GO!らじ丸』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青山さんと田村さんに変わって\n初回の放送に出演させていただけて\n嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族のような暖かい雰囲気のラジオで\n居心地が良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2つ目は\nATV青森テレビ『わっち!!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ飲んだ直後に出たので\nりんごジュースの話ばっかりしちゃいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん優しくて\nマネージャーさんにも\n楽しそうだったね！ と言われるほど\nただただ楽しみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3つ目は\nエフエム青森『ラジMOTT!』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公開生放送だったから\n来てくださったみなさんが見えたけど\nなかなか会えない青森の方々とお会いできて\n本当に嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中ずっと待って\n見ててくれてありがとう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいろいろ\n収録とか取材とかしていただいてきたので\nまた近くなったら告知します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんに\nアンダーライブ全国ツアー\n来ていただけたらいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のラジオやテレビで\n初めて乃木坂をちゃんと見たかた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日いた3人以外にも\nたくさん魅力的なメンバーが待ってますので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとでも気になってくださったかたは\nアンダーライブ全国ツアー\n来てください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/05/5761940/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ全国ツアー2016　～東北シリーズ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/19（火）\n福島：福島県文化センター　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/20（水）\n宮城：東京エレクトロンホール宮城"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/21（木）\n岩手：盛岡市民文化ホール　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/22（金）\n青森：八戸市公会堂　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/23（土）\n秋田：秋田市文化会館　大ホール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/24（日）\n山形：やまぎんホール（山形県県民会館）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}